  "releaseNotes": "**DI012 fixer conditional-access support**: The DI012 code fix now also offers to remove ignored `services?.TryAdd*(...)` registrations when the invocation expression is a `MemberBindingExpressionSyntax` inside a `ConditionalAccessExpressionSyntax`. The fixer still requires the enclosing statement to be a standalone block or top-level expression statement, so embedded single-line conditional-access bodies stay manual.",
